## Interface: 16001
## Title: Gather Skill Tooltip
## Notes: |cffff3333Minimap pins are broken. The herb and ore name is now a secret value, so the skill cannot be shown there. A fix is being worked on and may not be possible.|r Shows your skill and the required skill on a herb or ore in the world, and beside the level of a creature you can skin.
## Notes-deDE: |cffff3333Minimap pins are broken. The herb and ore name is now a secret value, so the skill cannot be shown there. A fix is being worked on and may not be possible.|r Zeigt deine Fertigkeit und die benötigte Fertigkeit, wenn du über ein Kraut oder Erz in der Welt fährst, und neben der Stufe einer Kreatur, die du häuten kannst.
## Notes-frFR: |cffff3333Minimap pins are broken. The herb and ore name is now a secret value, so the skill cannot be shown there. A fix is being worked on and may not be possible.|r Affiche votre compétence et la compétence requise quand vous survolez une herbe ou un minerai dans le monde, et à côté du niveau d'une créature que vous pouvez dépecer.
## Notes-esES: |cffff3333Minimap pins are broken. The herb and ore name is now a secret value, so the skill cannot be shown there. A fix is being worked on and may not be possible.|r Muestra tu habilidad y la requerida al pasar el cursor por una hierba o un mineral en el mundo, y junto al nivel de una criatura que puedes desollar.
## Notes-esMX: |cffff3333Minimap pins are broken. The herb and ore name is now a secret value, so the skill cannot be shown there. A fix is being worked on and may not be possible.|r Muestra tu habilidad y la requerida al pasar el cursor por una hierba o un mineral en el mundo, y junto al nivel de una criatura que puedes desollar.
## Notes-itIT: |cffff3333Minimap pins are broken. The herb and ore name is now a secret value, so the skill cannot be shown there. A fix is being worked on and may not be possible.|r Mostra la tua abilità e quella richiesta quando passi su un'erba o un minerale nel mondo, e accanto al livello di una creatura che puoi scuoiare.
## Notes-ptBR: |cffff3333Minimap pins are broken. The herb and ore name is now a secret value, so the skill cannot be shown there. A fix is being worked on and may not be possible.|r Mostra sua perícia e a perícia necessária ao passar o mouse em uma erva ou minério no mundo, e ao lado do nível de uma criatura que você pode esfolar.
## Notes-koKR: |cffff3333Minimap pins are broken. The herb and ore name is now a secret value, so the skill cannot be shown there. A fix is being worked on and may not be possible.|r 세계에서 약초나 광석에 커서를 올리면 내 숙련도와 필요 숙련도를 보여 줍니다. 무두질할 수 있는 생물의 레벨 옆에도 표시합니다.
## Notes-zhCN: |cffff3333Minimap pins are broken. The herb and ore name is now a secret value, so the skill cannot be shown there. A fix is being worked on and may not be possible.|r 将鼠标放在世界中的草药或矿石上时显示你的技能和所需技能。也会显示在可剥皮生物的等级旁边。
## Notes-zhTW: |cffff3333Minimap pins are broken. The herb and ore name is now a secret value, so the skill cannot be shown there. A fix is being worked on and may not be possible.|r 將滑鼠放在世界中的草藥或礦石上時顯示你的技能和所需技能。也會顯示在可剝皮生物的等級旁邊。
